<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="git-addon-interface-overview">
  <title>Git Client Interface Overview</title>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>interface overview</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>views</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>Git menu</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <conbody>
    <p id="p_git_client_interface_overview">The <ph keyref="plugin-git-client"/> adds dedicated Git
      views, a top-level <uicontrol>Git</uicontrol> menu, a <uicontrol>Preferences</uicontrol> page, and Git actions
      to context menus in <ph keyref="product"/>. This section describes where to find Git Client
      actions and how to use them.<table frame="all" rowsep="1" colsep="1" id="table_kqw_kx4_pjc">
        <title>Git Client workflow areas by location</title>
        <tgroup cols="3">
          <colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" colwidth="1*"/>
          <colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" colwidth="1*"/>
          <colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" colwidth="1*"/>
          <thead>
            <row>
              <entry>Location</entry>
              <entry>Workflow areas</entry>
              <entry>How to access</entry>
            </row>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <row>
              <entry><uicontrol
                  conref="git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs0-git-staging-view"/>
                view</entry>
              <entry>Review, stage, commit, push, and pull.</entry>
              <entry/>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry><uicontrol>Git Branch Manager</uicontrol> view</entry>
              <entry>Work with local and remote branches.</entry>
              <entry/>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry><uicontrol conref="git-history-view.dita#git-history-view/git-history"/>
                view</entry>
              <entry>Inspect commits and affected resources.</entry>
              <entry/>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry><uicontrol conref="sa-toolbar-git.dita#sa-toolbar-git/sa-toolbar-git"/>
                menu</entry>
              <entry>Multiple.</entry>
              <entry/>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry><uicontrol>Project </uicontrol>, <uicontrol>DITA Maps Manager</uicontrol>, and
                  <uicontrol>Editor</uicontrol> views.</entry>
              <entry>Multiple.</entry>
              <entry>Right-click a file or the current open file on <uicontrol>Editor</uicontrol>,
                and select <uicontrol
                  conref="sa-toolbar-git.dita#sa-toolbar-git/sa-context-menus-git-"/>.</entry>
            </row>
            <row>
              <entry><uicontrol>Preferences</uicontrol></entry>
              <entry>Configure preferred Git Client behavior</entry>
              <entry>On the <ph keyref="product"/> toolbar, go to <menucascade>
                  <uicontrol conkeyref="sa-toolbar/sa-toolbar-options"/>
                  <uicontrol conkeyref="sa-toolbar/sa-toolbar-options-preferences"/>
                </menucascade>.</entry>
            </row>
          </tbody>
        </tgroup>
      </table></p>
  </conbody>
</concept>
